  m_text: "EXAMPLE COMPARISON (approximate):\n\nLando Norris \u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026.
    ~0.18 s\nMax Verstappen \u2026\u2026\u2026.. ~0.18\u20130.19 s\nLewis Hamilton
    \u2026\u2026\u2026.. ~0.19\u20130.20 s\nCharles Leclerc \u2026\u2026\u2026. ~0.19\u20130.20
    s\nGeorge Russell \u2026\u2026\u2026.. ~0.19\u20130.21 s\nSergio P\xE9rez \u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026.
    ~0.20\u20130.22 s\nFernando Alonso \u2026\u2026\u2026. ~0.20\u20130.22 s\n\nYour
    average (Avg): check the \u201CAvg\u201D value in the game.\nBelow 0.17 s  :
    Elite (F1 level)\n0.18\u20130.22 s   : Very fast\n0.23\u20130.28 s   : Average\n0.28+
    s       : Needs improvement\n\n\n\n\n\n\n2 false starts will trigger an ad\n"
